    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any other symptoms along with the tiredness, like changes in appetite, weight loss or gain, or trouble sleeping?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've lost about 4 kg in two months without trying. I wake soaked in sweat two or three nights a week. I've been more thirsty than usual and passing urine more often.",
